      "id": "p2-codex-formula",
      "eyebrow": "OpenAI Codex CLI",
      "title": "Codex 四核心能力",
      "content": {
        "kind": "formula",
        "items": [
          "本地运行：npm/Homebrew/GitHub 安装，支持 macOS/Linux/Windows",
          "多模态输入：读写代码 + 执行命令 + 截图交互",
          "沙箱隔离：三档安全模式（ReadOnly/Auto/Full Access）",
          "账户集成：ChatGPT Plus/Pro/Business 或 API Key"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Apache-2.0 开源许可的轻量终端编程智能体"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "先看 OpenAI 的 Codex CLI。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一个能力是本地运行。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "支持三种主流系统，可以用 npm、Homebrew 或者 GitHub 二进制包安装。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "安装完就能在终端里直接用。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二个能力是多模态输入。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "既能读写代码，又能执行命令，还支持截图交互。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第三个关键能力是沙箱隔离。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "提供三档安全模式让你选。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s7.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "ReadOnly 模式只能看文件，Auto 模式自动执行，Full Access 就是完全开放。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s8.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第四个能力是账户集成。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s9.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "可以用 ChatGPT 的各类账号，或者自己的 API Key。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s10.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "整个项目是 Apache-2.0 开源的，代码在 GitHub 上。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p2-codex-formula-s11.mp3"
        }
      ],
