    {
      "id": "p3-duo-codex-deepseek",
      "eyebrow": "开源实现对比",
      "title": "Codex vs DeepSeek Harness",
      "content": {
        "kind": "duo",
        "left": {
          "title": "OpenAI Codex CLI",
          "tag": "轻量终端智能体",
          "body": "- **本地优先**：直接运行在用户机器上\n- **安全审批**：ReadOnly/Auto/Full Access 三档\n- **账户绑定**：集成 ChatGPT 或 API Key\n- **开源许可**：Apache-2.0，社区可自由修改\n- **安装简单**：npm/Homebrew/GitHub 一键部署"
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "DeepSeek Harness (dsh)",
          "tag": "插件化架构",
          "body": "- **一切皆插件**：模型/工具/技能/沙箱均可热插拔\n- **Cordis 内核**：负责插件挂载/卸载与依赖管理\n- **四种运行模式**：Standard/Code/Minimal/Creator\n- **全程可追溯**：会话日志仅追加，支持 Resume/Fork\n- **开发者预览**：MIT 许可，当前存在兼容性破坏变更"
        }
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "现在对比两个开源实现。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "左边是 OpenAI 的 Codex CLI，主打轻量级终端智能体。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它优先在本地运行，直接装在你机器上。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "安全审批分三档，从只读到完全开放。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "账户绑定 ChatGPT 或 API Key，开源许可宽松。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "右边是 DeepSeek 的 Harness，代号 dsh。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它的核心理念是一切皆插件。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "模型、工具、技能、沙箱全部可以热插拔。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s7.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "由 Cordis 内核统一管理插件的挂载和卸载。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s8.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "提供四种运行模式适应不同场景。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s9.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "会话全程可追溯，支持暂停、恢复和分支。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s10.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "目前是开发者预览版，MIT 许可，但还有兼容性破坏变更。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p3-duo-codex-deepseek-s11.mp3"
        }
      ],
