      "id": "p5-mcp-code-execution",
      "eyebrow": "令牌优化实践",
      "title": "MCP 代码执行模式",
      "content": {
        "kind": "code",
        "language": "typescript",
        "lines": [
          {
            "code": "// 传统模式：工具定义膨胀 + 上下文消耗",
            "comment": "问题：每次调用都加载完整工具定义",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "const tools = [listFilesTool, searchTool, editTool, ...]; // 数百个工具",
            "comment": "工具列表塞满上下文窗口",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "const result = await agent.call(tool, context); // 全量返回",
            "comment": "中间结果全部回传 LLM",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "// MCP 模式：代码按需发现 + 数据过滤",
            "comment": "解法：执行环境动态加载工具",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "const mcpServer = await MCP.connect('fs-executor');",
            "comment": "连接文件系统执行器",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "const filtered = await mcpServer.exec(`ls *.py | grep test`);",
            "comment": "在沙箱内过滤数据",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "await context.writeSummary(filtered); // 仅写摘要",
            "comment": "只输出结果摘要",
            "highlight": null
          }
        ],
        "note": "Anthropic 报告：MCP 代码执行在规模化场景下令牌节省达 98.7%"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "深入看一个关键工程突破：MCP 代码执行模式。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "问题是什么？",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "传统模式下，工具定义全部塞进上下文，每次调用都加载完整列表。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "中间结果全部回传给大模型，上下文迅速膨胀。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "MCP 的思路是什么？",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "让代码执行环境动态加载工具，而不是预先定义。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "在沙箱内过滤数据，只输出结果摘要。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "看代码右边注释的对比。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-engineering-practice/p5-mcp-code-execution-s7.mp3"
        },
